OL,3,GNEWSAPets to be blessed at special
OL,4,Acathedral service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cathedral is once again inviting
OL,7,Fpeople to come and have their pets
OL,8,Fblessed during a special service.
OL,10,FSalisbury Cathedral first held the All
OL,11,FCreatures Great and Small celebration
OL,12,Fin 2024 to give thanks to animals and
OL,13,Fthe companionship they bring.
OL,15,FSince then, staff said the annual event
OL,16,Fhad been a great success with more than
OL,17,F250 people attending last year, along
OL,18,Fwith 60 dogs, guinea pigs, mice, cats,
OL,19,Fgerbils and a tortoise.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
