OL,3,GNEWSAPets to be blessed at special
OL,4,Acathedral service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year's service will take place on
OL,7,FSaturday at 14:00 BST in the west end
OL,8,Fof the cathedral, with the large doors
OL,9,Fopening onto the lawn for larger
OL,10,Fanimals who are unable to enter.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
